{
  "info": {
    "name": "OracleMcpHttp",
    "description": "Collection para testar o servidor MCP do Oracle via HTTP (JSON-RPC 2.0).\n\nFluxo:\n1. Configure `mcp_api_key` (uma das chaves de `McpAuth:ApiKeys`) e, se quiser gravar as credenciais na key, `oracle_connection`.\n2. Execute **0. Generate API Key** — a key composta é salva em `api_key`.\n3. Execute **1. Initialize** e **1.1 Initialized** — o `mcp-session-id` é salvo automaticamente.\n4. Execute `connect`, depois as consultas/comandos e por fim `disconnect`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5464",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Generate API Key",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json && json.apiKey) pm.environment.set('api_key', json.apiKey);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{mcp_api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"mcpApiKey\": \"{{mcp_api_key}}\",\n  \"connectionString\": \"{{oracle_connection}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api-key/generate",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api-key",
            "generate"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Gera a key composta do header `x-api-key` e salva em `api_key`. Aqui o header `x-api-key` é a chave MCP em texto puro. Deixe `oracle_connection` em branco para usar a connection string do servidor."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "0. Decode API Key",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{mcp_api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"apiKey\": \"{{api_key}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api-key/decode",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api-key",
            "decode"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Desfaz a key composta e mostra a chave MCP e a connection string gravadas nela."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "0. Test Connection",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{mcp_api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"connectionString\": \"{{oracle_connection}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api-key/test-connection",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api-key",
            "test-connection"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Abre e fecha uma conexão com a connection string informada, para validar as credenciais."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Initialize",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var sessionId = pm.response.headers.get('mcp-session-id');",
              "if (sessionId) pm.environment.set('mcp_session_id', sessionId);",
              "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"initialize\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"protocolVersion\": \"2025-06-18\",\n    \"capabilities\": {},\n    \"clientInfo\": {\n      \"name\": \"postman\",\n      \"version\": \"1.0\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "mcp"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Inicia a sessão MCP. O `mcp-session-id` retornado é salvo automaticamente."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "1.1 Initialized",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "mcp-session-id",
            "value": "{{mcp_session_id}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"method\": \"notifications/initialized\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "mcp"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Notificação que conclui o handshake MCP."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. List Tools",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "mcp-session-id",
            "value": "{{mcp_session_id}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 2,\n  \"method\": \"tools/list\",\n  \"params\": {}\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "mcp"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Lista as tools disponíveis."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Oracle",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "connect",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{api_key}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "mcp-session-id",
                "value": "{{mcp_session_id}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 10,\n  \"method\": \"tools/call\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"name\": \"connect\",\n    \"arguments\": {}\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mcp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Abre a conexão da sessão (usa a connection string da key, do servidor ou do parâmetro connection_string, nessa ordem)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "execute_query",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{api_key}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "mcp-session-id",
                "value": "{{mcp_session_id}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 11,\n  \"method\": \"tools/call\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"name\": \"execute_query\",\n    \"arguments\": {\n      \"sql\": \"SELECT table_name FROM user_tables ORDER BY table_name FETCH FIRST 20 ROWS ONLY\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mcp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Executa um SELECT."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "execute_query (bind variables)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{api_key}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "mcp-session-id",
                "value": "{{mcp_session_id}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 12,\n  \"method\": \"tools/call\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"name\": \"execute_query\",\n    \"arguments\": {\n      \"sql\": \"SELECT owner, object_name, object_type FROM all_objects WHERE object_name = :nome\",\n      \"parameters_json\": \"{\\\"nome\\\": \\\"DUAL\\\"}\",\n      \"max_rows\": 50\n    }\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mcp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "SELECT com bind variable nomeada."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "execute_command",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{api_key}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "mcp-session-id",
                "value": "{{mcp_session_id}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 13,\n  \"method\": \"tools/call\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"name\": \"execute_command\",\n    \"arguments\": {\n      \"sql\": \"BEGIN NULL; END;\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mcp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Executa um bloco PL/SQL (ou INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/DDL)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "disconnect",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{api_key}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "mcp-session-id",
                "value": "{{mcp_session_id}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 14,\n  \"method\": \"tools/call\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"name\": \"disconnect\",\n    \"arguments\": {}\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mcp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fecha a conexão da sessão."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Shell",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "get_shell_info",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{api_key}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "mcp-session-id",
                "value": "{{mcp_session_id}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 20,\n  \"method\": \"tools/call\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"name\": \"get_shell_info\",\n    \"arguments\": {}\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mcp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Informações do shell do servidor (exige Shell:Enabled=true)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "execute_shell_command",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{api_key}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "mcp-session-id",
                "value": "{{mcp_session_id}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 21,\n  \"method\": \"tools/call\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"name\": \"execute_shell_command\",\n    \"arguments\": {\n      \"command\": \"echo ola\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/mcp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mcp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Executa um comando no shell do servidor (exige Shell:Enabled=true)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}